msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>L'Amuleto di Haruka<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Thanks a ton, Uncle Kaz! I have a present for you!"
msgstr "Grazie mille, zio Kaz! Ho un regalo per te!"

msgctxt "892"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Haruka's Chocolate<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>Il cioccolato di Haruka<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Thanks a ton, Uncle Kaz! I have a present for you!"
msgstr "Grazie mille, zio Kaz! Ho un regalo per te!"

msgctxt "952"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Haruka's Candy<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>Dolcetto di Haruka<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Hello. Will this be for here, or to go?"
msgstr "Salve. Per consumare qui o da asporto?"

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "To go, please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "All right. Here's our menu."
msgstr "Allora. Ecco il nostro menu."

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "For here, please."
msgstr "Per qui, per favore."

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "All right. Here's our menu."
msgstr "Allora. Ecco il nostro menu."

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "(No point eating now. I'm not even hungry.)"
msgstr "(Inutile mangiare adesso. Non ho neanche fame.)"

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Sorry, something came up."
msgstr "Mi dispiace, è saltato fuori un imprevisto."

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "All right, then. Please come again."
msgstr "Perfetto. Torni a trovarci."

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your business! Say, are you a fan of our braised pork burger? "
"It's getting to be quite popular!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Braised pork? In a burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"That's right! The gravure model Yuna-san wrote about her obsession with it "
"on her blog. Ever since then, we've had droves of people coming in, asking "
"for the braised pork burger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid ""
"I never knew blogs could be so influential. Heck, these burgers are selling "
"better than when we were running commercials about them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"It's that melt-in-your-mouth meat that's the kicker. Once you take a bite, "
"you're hooked!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid ""
"(A pork burger that's gained popularity through bloggers, huh? I should "
"remember this when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "To Go"
msgstr "Da asporto."

